  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 39 + 4 ÷ 5 - 57 × 3 = 40 \n\n**Option 1) ÷ and ×**\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 39 + 4 × 5 - **__57 ÷ 3__** = 40\n\n⇒ 39 + __**4 **____**× **____**5**__ - 19 = 40 \n\n⇒ __**39 + 20**__ - 19 = 40\n\n⇒ __**59 - 19**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ 40 = 40 \n\nOption 2) ÷ and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ __**39 ÷ 4**__ + 5 - 57 × 3 = 40\n\n⇒ 9.75 + 5 - __**57 × 3**__ = 40 \n\n⇒ **__9.75 + 5__** - 171 = 40 \n\n⇒ **__14.75 - 171__** = 40\n\n⇒ -156.25 ≠ 40 \n\nOption 3) - and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 39 + __**4 ÷ 5**__ - 57 × 3 = 40 \n\n⇒ 39 + 0.8 - __**57 × 3**__ = 40\n\n⇒ **__39 + 0.8__** - 171 = 40\n\n⇒ **__39.8 - 171__** = 40\n\n⇒ -131.2 ≠ 40\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 39 + __**4 ÷ 5**__ × 57 - 3 = 40\n\n⇒ 39 + __**0.8 **____**×**____** 57**__ - 3 = 40\n\n⇒ **__39 + 45.6__** - 3 = 40\n\n⇒ __**84.6 - 3**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 81.6 ≠ 40\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷ and +\".",
